    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "CANADA is a Barcelona-founded directors collective and production company (est. 2008, founders Nicolas Mendez, Lope Serrano, Luis Cervero), specialising in music videos, commercials and short films. Three offices: Barcelona (HQ, Poblenou), London, and Los Angeles; roster of 18 directors as of 2024. Clients include Nike, Apple, Louis Vuitton, Coca-Cola, Dua Lipa, Rosalia and Tame Impala; awards include Cannes Lions, Latin Grammy (2020), D&AD and UK Music Video Awards. Well-established, ~15 years in operation. Autonomy not applicable (studio entity, not an individual). Work Status: Studio is unambiguous. LinkedIn employee count 11-50; APA roster lists 18 directors plus production heads, consistent with 11-40 estimate. Country: primary HQ Spain, confirmed offices in UK and USA.",
